msgid ""
"The open programs there close, the computer signs out and back in by itself "
"(without restarting) and locks the screen; this window connects again. "
"Unsaved work there is lost."
msgstr ""
"Os programas abertos lá fecham, o computador sai e entra de novo sozinho "
"(sem reiniciar) e bloqueia a tela; esta janela se conecta de novo. O que não "
"estiver salvo lá será perdido."

